g — letting more people play it, for longer, in their own language.SIX LANGUAGESCage Legacy ships in English, Deutsch, Español, Italiano, 简体中文 and Afrikaans.Switch any time from Settings → Language. No restart, no reinstall. Your choice is saved t","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-29T20:42:36Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951306420","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5002990-1840310314340032","game_id":"steam-5002990","kind":"announcement","title":"The demo was too short. It's now 60 weeks","summary":"The Cage Legacy demo has gone from 20 turns to 60.I put the short version out a few days ago and then looked at what Steam wastelling me. The median player was finishing it. Not quitting — finishing, and asixth of them were restarting and playing it again three or four times. That'snot a demo people are bouncing off. That's a demo that ends before it's saidanything.And what it wasn't saying is the actual game. Cage Legacy is about long arcs —fighters who age, decline, get injured, lose their ner","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-05T19:19:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840310314340032","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-5002990-1839676055898219","game_id":"steam-5002990","kind":"announcement","title":"The demo is out — 20 turns, about 10 minutes","summary":"The Cage Legacy demo is live and free.You get 20 turns: scout fighters, negotiate a contract or two, run a trainingcamp, manage a weight cut, and work the corner during a fight night — changetactics between rounds, treat damage, decide whether to push a tired fighter orprotect him.It takes seven to ten minutes to finish. That's deliberate for a first look, andit's also the thing I'm least sure about — a management sim is supposed to beabout long arcs, fighters aging and declining and retiring, a","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-04T19:00:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1839676055898219","verified_at":"2026-10-20T20:17:44Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-5002990":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T16:20:25Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T16:20:24Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-5002990":"2026-10-26T16:20:25Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"5002990":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T16:20:24Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T16:20:24Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T16:20:24Z"},"5018150":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T16:20:25Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T16:20:25Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[],"last_fulltext_checked_at":"2026-10-26T16:20:25Z"}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-5002990","app_id":5002990,"app_scope":"base","observed_at":"2026-10-26T06:15:16Z","source_url":"https://api.steampowered.com/IStoreBrowseService/GetItems/v1/","context":{"country":"KR","language":"koreana","batch_size":100},"status":"ok","error_code":null,"store_item_success":1,"raw_item_sha256":"c261458cea1342d43a90d32ae08736287d2f6315398bb3696b4eddcad0e8d58d","response_sha256":null,"source_fields":{"basic_info":{"short_description":"Build a struggling MMA gym into a title-winning empire. Scout fighters, negotiate contracts, run training camps, survive the drama, balance every dollar, and work the corner live during fully simulated fight nights. A single-player pixel-art management sim.","publishers":[{"name":"Werner Viljoen","creator_clan_account_id":46304042}],"developers":[{"name":"Werner Viljoen","creator_clan_account_id":4